## Cline

- The rules above are the content of `~/.agents/CORE.md`; do not re-read it (if the first line of this file is a literal include directive, read that file now instead). Before file writes, multi-step tool work, delegation, or current-fact research, read `~/.agents/ROUTER.md`, then only the packs it selects in `~/.agents/instructions/`. If a file is missing, continue with this rule and say so.
- Skills are installed in `~/.cline/skills/` (same set as `~/.agents/skills/`). Use `verify-claims` before treating a report as fact or committing.
- No role subagents are installed for Cline. When the guidance above says to delegate, do the step yourself with read-only commands and keep only a short evidence summary in the conversation.
